372
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:49,500
Sen--

373
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:51,210
Huh?

374
00:10:51,210 --> 00:10:53,840
Can't you come over to my place?

375
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:56,050
I wanna hang in my room.

376
00:10:56,050 --> 00:10:58,710
N-No, thanks...

377
00:11:02,090 --> 00:11:02,960
Wow, Sengoku!

378
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:05,380
You made her cry!

379
00:11:05,380 --> 00:11:07,170
You okay, Remi- <i>chan</i> ?

380
00:11:07,170 --> 00:11:08,710
That must've been shocking to hear.

