410
00:11:21,090 --> 00:11:25,000
I don't even wanna talk
about it, but here goes!

411
00:11:27,170 --> 00:11:29,130
Come on in.

412
00:11:30,290 --> 00:11:31,960
INSECTS GALORE!

413
00:11:32,090 --> 00:11:36,880
The mantis! The mantis
is gonna stare at me!

414
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:39,130
Th-They're not mine! They're
my Dad's! I'll take them down!

415
00:11:39,130 --> 00:11:41,210
The... mantis?

416
00:11:42,590 --> 00:11:46,500
You had your end-of-semester assembly
today, right? Did you get your grades?

417
00:11:48,220 --> 00:11:50,230
"Kyoko Hori Semester Report Card"

418
00:11:50,090 --> 00:11:54,460
Oh, wow, look! She's got A's
in everything except Art and P.E.!

419
00:11:54,460 --> 00:11:57,710
Kyoko's a smarty-pants like her dad.

420
00:11:57,710 --> 00:12:01,210
Well, I really hate to agree with you,

421
00:12:01,210 --> 00:12:03,420
but yes, I suppose she does
take after you in math.

422
00:12:03,420 --> 00:12:05,000
Why the weird preface?

423
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:07,840
This is such an emotional moment!

424
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:08,590
Why?

425
00:12:08,590 --> 00:12:10,300
Hey, Yuri- <i>chan</i> , I asked you a question.

426
00:12:10,300 --> 00:12:15,590
The next time you get your grades,
you'll be graduating!

427
00:12:17,750 --> 00:12:21,050
You failed tons of tests at
the start of your senior year.

428
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:20,210
Oh, right.

429
00:12:20,210 --> 00:12:24,380
Starting this April, I won't be
in high school anymore.

430
00:12:21,050 --> 00:12:24,380
Your memory for petty details
is one thing I really dislike about you.

431
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:26,050
Look at mine, sis!

432
00:12:26,050 --> 00:12:29,340
Wow, great job!

433
00:12:29,340 --> 00:12:34,920
I wonder what I'll be doing
around this time next year.

434
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:39,960
After I graduate...
what will my life be like?

435
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:44,960
Hey, sis, are you looking?
Look at my grades!

436
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:49,130
Wait, you just said we were both
good at math! Are you even listening?

437
00:12:45,050 --> 00:12:49,130
Are you listening to me?

438
00:12:49,130 --> 00:12:50,920
Shut up!

439
00:12:53,090 --> 00:12:55,300
Thank you very much!

440
00:13:07,460 --> 00:13:10,210
That's a huge Christmas tree...

441
00:13:11,130 --> 00:13:13,380
Watch where you're going,
or you'll trip and fall.

442
00:13:13,380 --> 00:13:17,420
Oh, you're Yoshikawa- <i>san</i> 's older sister!

443
00:13:17,420 --> 00:13:20,130
You're not wearing your glasses today.

444
00:13:20,130 --> 00:13:22,750
I actually just got contacts.

445
00:13:22,750 --> 00:13:27,340
Oh, nice. I should think
about getting contacts.

446
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:30,420
Would you like me to buy you some?

447
00:13:30,420 --> 00:13:31,710
What? Why?

448
00:13:31,710 --> 00:13:33,800
Today is Christmas after all.

449
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:38,300
It's a little weird for a high-school kid
to buy a college student contacts.

450
00:13:38,300 --> 00:13:40,090
You're wearing a suit today.

451
00:13:40,090 --> 00:13:43,920
Yeah, I'm interviewing for jobs. It sucks.

452
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:47,590
Meanwhile, my dumbass sister
spends all her time screwing around.

453
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:53,170
You can laugh.
It's funny because it's true.

454
00:13:53,170 --> 00:13:56,800
Go on, laugh. She's dumber
than a bag of rocks.

455
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:59,800
Oh, no, I meant...

456
00:14:01,670 --> 00:14:04,460
Let's take a look...

457
00:14:06,170 --> 00:14:08,750
Want me to go buy some dessert?

458
00:14:08,750 --> 00:14:09,880
I'm good.

459
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:15,170
Get out of the way, dude!
How am I supposed to watch TV?!

460
00:14:15,170 --> 00:14:18,090
The hell kind of tone is that?! I don't
care if you're my brother, you're dead!

461
00:14:18,090 --> 00:14:21,500
And put your gross tissues
in the trash can, you dumbass!

462
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:25,920
I did! Kiko keeps taking them out!

463
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:29,170
Yeah, right!

464
00:14:30,380 --> 00:14:33,250
Dammit, now it's over!

465
00:14:33,250 --> 00:14:36,090
Keep your germs away from me!

466
00:14:40,650 --> 00:14:42,650
"High School Exam Kanji"

467
00:14:42,650 --> 00:14:44,520
"Middle School Math Review"

