You don't have to. It's so cold out.

576
00:17:22,050 --> 00:17:23,550
I'm coming!

577
00:17:24,710 --> 00:17:26,590
It's not <i>that</i> cold.

578
00:17:33,380 --> 00:17:36,050
It's so quiet with all the snow.

579
00:17:39,210 --> 00:17:41,880
Hori- <i>san</i> 's gone quiet, too.

580
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:50,840
We're graduating soon, huh.

581
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:54,420
Soon? We've got a while, don't we?

582
00:17:55,710 --> 00:17:57,750
You know, I...

583
00:18:00,210 --> 00:18:05,420
I still don't know that
much about you, Miyamura.

584
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:09,880
There's tons I don't know.

585
00:18:13,380 --> 00:18:16,130
Hori- <i>san</i> , I...

586
00:18:16,130 --> 00:18:19,920
I don't know very much about you.

587
00:18:23,380 --> 00:18:24,670
But I...

588
00:18:24,670 --> 00:18:27,460
I want to be with you,

589
00:18:27,460 --> 00:18:30,800
e-even <i>after</i> we graduate!

590
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:37,460
I-I mean, if that's okay.

591
00:18:42,130 --> 00:18:46,630
P-Please say something.

592
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:50,050
Okay.

593
00:18:57,210 --> 00:18:59,170
Let's get married!

594
00:19:08,210 --> 00:19:09,840
Oh, God.

595
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:11,250
Okay, bye!

596
00:19:11,250 --> 00:19:13,880
I'll make you happy!

597
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:14,750
What?!

598
00:19:14,750 --> 00:19:19,880
I <i>said</i> , I'll make you happy, Miyamura!

599
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:22,840
Isn't the <i>guy</i> supposed
to say that to the <i>girl</i> ?!

600
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:24,250
It doesn't make sense that way!

601
00:19:24,250 --> 00:19:27,460
I'm self-centered, and all
I'm good at is studying and chores!

602
00:19:26,510 --> 00:19:29,770
"crunch crunch"

603
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:28,710
And I'm not nice to people, either!

604
00:19:28,710 --> 00:19:30,090
Wait, what?!

605
00:19:30,090 --> 00:19:33,800
So you can't be the one saying it!

606
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:39,750
I don't think that's
how it works, but okay.

607
00:19:39,750 --> 00:19:41,880
I look forward to our future together.

608
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:44,460
Uh, yeah, same here.

609
00:19:54,420 --> 00:19:55,290
JUMP

610
00:19:57,300 --> 00:20:01,380
Right! Right! I'm coming--

611
00:20:01,380 --> 00:20:03,300
Sorry, I gotta head back to the shop!

612
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:05,710
Oh, sure, good luck!

613
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:17,840
I'm freezing! I better get home, too!

614
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:29,500
My face is all hot.

615
00:21:56,620 --> 00:22:00,040
I Would Gift You the Sky

616
00:22:04,130 --> 00:22:07,300
Do you go to the shrine
on New Year's every year?

617
00:22:07,300 --> 00:22:11,050
I try to. How about you?

618
00:22:11,050 --> 00:22:13,840
Only when it gets less crowded.

619
00:22:15,090 --> 00:22:18,550
Wanna go together this year?

620
00:22:19,230 --> 00:22:21,150
"shake shake"

621
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:23,190
"Fortune"

622
00:22:23,420 --> 00:22:25,960
What's yours say?

623
00:22:25,960 --> 00:22:28,750
"Keep calm and carry on," basically.

624
00:22:28,750 --> 00:22:30,800
You sure that's it?

625
00:22:30,800 --> 00:22:36,460
I mean, as long as you keep smiling,
I don't need much more.

626
00:22:37,460 --> 00:22:39,380
What was that? I couldn't hear you.

627
00:22:39,380 --> 00:22:40,210
Nothing.

628
00:22:40,210 --> 00:22:41,050
Really?

629
00:22:41,050 --> 00:22:43,420
I didn't say anything.

630
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:49,210
I'm happy as long as you're smiling, too.

631
00:22:50,800 --> 00:22:52,500
So you <i>did</i> hear.

632
00:22:52,500 --> 00:22:54,170
Hear what?

633
00:22:54,470 --> 00:22:56,720
Amazake

634
00:22:56,710 --> 00:22:59,380
It's kind of weird, you know?

635
00:22:59,380 --> 00:23:02,130
You're the last person I see this year,

636
00:23:02,130 --> 00:23:05,880
and the first person I see next year.

637
00:23:08,340 --> 00:23:11,300
Yeah.

638
00:23:11,300 --> 00:23:15,880
I hope it'll be like that
every year from now on.

639
00:23:32,670 --> 00:23:35,250
Hey, Miyamura?

640
00:23:35,250 --> 00:23:38,000
Will we be together forever?

641
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:40,130
Yup, together forever.

642
00:23:49,250 --> 00:23:51,460
Forever.

